    <h2 id="sts-formula">The formula in depth</h2>
    <p>Safe to Spend is calculated as follows:</p>
    <div class="doc-formula">
      Safe to Spend = (Remaining Budget − Bill Reserve − Savings Reserve) ÷ max(Days Remaining, 1)
    </div>
    <p>Each variable explained:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Remaining Budget.</strong> Your total period budget minus all spending you've
        logged this period from Cash, Debit, and Credit pools. Savings transfers are excluded so
        they don't double-count against your budget.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Bill Reserve.</strong> The sum of all unpaid <strong>red (Essentials)</strong>
        bills due in the current period. BudgetBaby assumes you must pay these obligations and
        reserves the money so you can't accidentally spend it. Once you mark a red bill paid, the
        reserve releases.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Savings Reserve.</strong> The portion of your savings target that hasn't been
        contributed yet. If your monthly savings target is $480 and you've moved $200 into goals
        this period, the reserve is $280. Reaching your target zeroes the reserve.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Days Remaining.</strong> Calendar days left in the current budget period, including
        today, with a hard minimum of 1. The minimum-1 clamp means the daily rate stays sensible
        on the last day of a period.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="doc-tip">
      <strong>See your actual numbers.</strong> Tap the info button next to Safe to Spend on the
      home screen. The breakdown sheet shows period budget, spent, bill reserve, savings reserve,
      days remaining, and the resulting daily rate, every input is visible.
    </div>

    <div class="doc-mocks-row">
      <DocMock label="Breakdown sheet" caption="Tap (i) on the home screen to see every component of the calculation.">
        <div class="dm-sheet-handle"></div>
        <div class="dm-bar"><span></span><span class="dm-bar-title">Safe to Spend</span><span class="dm-bar-action">Done</span></div>
